jobs.description:
Our client is a leading international law firm with a strong presence in Belgium and a highly professional corporate environment. The organisation actively invests in employer branding, talent attraction and events to strengthen its connection with students, young professionals and the wider talent market.

Jobomschrijving

The freelance HR employer Branding & Events specialist will:

• Coordinate and follow up on upcoming employer branding and recruitment events ;
• Manage event planning, logistics, timelines and practical follow-up ;
• Coordinate internal stakeholders, external partners and event suppliers ;
• Support campus recruitment activities and relationships with universities ;
• Ensure consistent employer branding across events and recruitment initiatives ;
• Follow up on invitations, registrations, communications and event materials ;
• Manage multiple projects, events and priorities simultaneously ;
• Provide structured reporting and follow-up to the HR and Talent team ;

A successful freelance HR employer Branding & Events specialist should have:

• Experience in Employer Branding, Campus Recruitment, HR or Talent Acquisition ;
• Corporate background within a law firm, Big4, bank or similar environment ;
• Proven experience organising and coordinating professional events ;
• Strong stakeholder management and communication skills ;
• Highly organised, structured and able to manage multiple priorities ;
• Hands-on mentality with strong attention to detail ;
• Fluent in English and Dutch or English and French ;
• Comfortable working independently in a fast-paced professional environment ;
